# nexora-action-code: get_lldp_neighbors
Value Required NEIGHBOR_NAME (\S+)
Value Required LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Required CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value Required NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE (\S+|Port\s+\d+)

Start
  ^\s*System\s+Name\s+Local\s+Interface\s+Chassis\s+ID\s+Port\s+ID\s*$$ -> SystemFirst
  ^\s*Local\s+Interface\s+Chassis\s+ID\s+Port\s+ID\s+System\s+Name\s*$$ -> InterfaceFirst
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*

SystemFirst
  ^\s*${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s+${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*

InterfaceFirst
  ^\s*${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s+${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*
